{"seq":4,"slug":"spatial-machine-learning","title":"空间机器学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/applied-geospatial/spatial-machine-learning","wordCount":614,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"空间机器学习\">空间机器学习</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>空间机器学习（Spatial Machine Learning）将地理空间特征和空间关系融入机器学习模型，解决传统 ML 方法忽略空间依赖性和空间异质性的问题。空间数据的核心挑战在于观测值之间不独立（空间自相关），直接使用随机分割的交叉验证会导致信息泄漏和过于乐观的性能评估。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[空间机器学习] --&gt; B[空间特征工程]&#10;    A --&gt; C[空间交叉验证]&#10;    A --&gt; D[空间感知模型]&#10;    B --&gt; E[距离特征]&#10;    B --&gt; F[邻域统计]&#10;    B --&gt; G[空间嵌入]&#10;    C --&gt; H[空间分块 CV]&#10;    C --&gt; I[缓冲区 CV]&#10;    D --&gt; J[空间随机森林]&#10;    D --&gt; K[图神经网络]&#10;    D --&gt; L[空间卷积]\">graph TD\n    A[空间机器学习] --&gt; B[空间特征工程]\n    A --&gt; C[空间交叉验证]\n    A --&gt; D[空间感知模型]\n    B --&gt; E[距离特征]\n    B --&gt; F[邻域统计]\n    B --&gt; G[空间嵌入]\n    C --&gt; H[空间分块 CV]\n    C --&gt; I[缓冲区 CV]\n    D --&gt; J[空间随机森林]\n    D --&gt; K[图神经网络]\n    D --&gt; L[空间卷积]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>传统 ML</th>\n<th>空间 ML</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据分割</td>\n<td>随机分割</td>\n<td>空间分块</td>\n<td>空间交叉验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征独立性</td>\n<td>假设独立</td>\n<td>空间自相关</td>\n<td>空间特征 + 残差检验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系均匀性</td>\n<td>全局系数</td>\n<td>空间异质</td>\n<td>局部模型 / GWR-ML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过拟合评估</td>\n<td>标准 CV</td>\n<td>信息泄漏</td>\n<td>空间缓冲 CV</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"空间特征工程\">空间特征工程</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import geopandas as gpd&#10;import numpy as np&#10;from sklearn.neighbors import BallTree&#10;&#10;gdf = gpd.read_file(&quot;data.shp&quot;)&#10;coords = np.column_stack([gdf.geometry.centroid.y, gdf.geometry.centroid.x])&#10;coords_rad = np.radians(coords)&#10;&#10;tree = BallTree(coords_rad, metric=&#39;haversine&#39;)&#10;&#10;def spatial_features(gdf, tree, coords_rad, radii=[1000, 3000, 5000]):&#10;    features = {}&#10;    for r in radii:&#10;        r_rad = r / 6371000&#10;        indices = tree.query_radius(coords_rad, r=r_rad)&#10;        for col in [&#39;price&#39;, &#39;population&#39;]:&#10;            values = gdf[col].values&#10;            features[f&#39;{col}_mean_{r}m&#39;] = [&#10;                values[idx].mean() if len(idx) &gt; 1 else values[i]&#10;                for i, idx in enumerate(indices)&#10;            ]&#10;            features[f&#39;{col}_std_{r}m&#39;] = [&#10;                values[idx].std() if len(idx) &gt; 1 else 0&#10;                for i, idx in enumerate(indices)&#10;            ]&#10;    return features\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> geopandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.neighbors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BallTree</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gdf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpd.read_file(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"data.shp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">coords </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.column_stack([gdf.geometry.centroid.y, gdf.geometry.centroid.x])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">coords_rad </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.radians(coords)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tree </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BallTree(coords_rad, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'haversine'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> spatial_features</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gdf, tree, coords_rad, radii</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--s